---
/**
 * 6.7 The divider band. The hinge of the page: culture above, practical below.
 *
 * id="plan" so the whole second half is reachable at visitmoganshan.com/#plan,
 * which is the link to hand somebody who has already decided to come.
 *
 * The band also acts as the trigger for the mobile plan bar; see PlanBar.astro.
 */
---

<section class="divider" id="plan" aria-labelledby="divider-title" data-plan-anchor>
  <div class="vm-container">
    <p class="vm-kicker vm-kicker--amber">Plan the trip</p>
    <h2 id="divider-title" class="divider__line">
      Everything below this line answers a question, not a mood.
    </h2>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .divider {
    background: var(--color-ink);
    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    /* The band spans the sticky header's scroll-margin so an anchored jump does
       not park the heading underneath it. */
    scroll-margin-top: 68px;
  }

  .divider__line {
    max-width: 30ch;
    margin-inline: auto;
    font-size: clamp(1.375rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-mist);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
</style>
